Using $T^3 = x^3+y^3+z^3 + 3T(xy+yz+zx) - 3xyz = x^3+y^3+z^3 + 3T(xy+yz+zx) - 3$, the right side becomes $x(x^3+y^3+z^3 - 3)$. Since $x^4 - 3x + x(y^3+z^3) = x(x^3+y^3+z^3 - 3)$, equality holds.

